Z||000000||ThatRickGuy||03-05-2001||12:59 PM||||I was on my way home from the club I work at up in DC this weekend, it was probrably about 3:30-4:00 am. I was still in Down town DC, on 14th street (basicly, a very straight road w/ stop lights every 100 yards or so. I wind up at the front of a stop light and hear some nuetral reving from the left lane. Sure enough, 2 kids in an Eclipse one of them waves and makes like they want to race. Knowing the light patterns from making this drive every week for the last 2 years, I knew it would only be a one light run, so I figured, hey, lets see how the 3.2 holds up against a new turbo. Light went green, I hammered the gas, just a little chirp and I was hooked up solid, I heard him spin a second, but he got off the line pretty good. I kept up nose to nose for a bit, but once he hit the higher RPMs he started pulling away, I figured I was cooked. But then he shifted, judging from the exhaust noise, probrably arround 5k, a little early just enough to slow him down for me to get my noise back up to his rear wheels. Right about there we had to shut down for the next light and traffic. He cut over to the other side of me at the light, and rolled down the window, we chatted for a few seconds till the light went green again, but all in all, he seemed like a pretty nice kid, I don't feel bad being beaten  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||10
Z||000001||turbo86se||03-05-2001||04:05 PM||||Those Eclipses's just look fast. My brother has a '99 Eclipse Spyder with turbo, 5-spd, every option he could get. He took me for a ride in it one day and I wasn't that impressed. Then we took a ride in my turbo 2.8 Fiero, you should have seen the look on his face. He said he'd never keep up, and where are the "oh sh** bars!" LOL<P>Even a buddy of mine that races Porsche 914's braced his hands on the dash when I layed into the turbo! I just love the way the front end "drops" when you let off the gas.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=226077&a=1676320&p=20236791"> ||||reg||1
